Pattern Card — Bad News Absorption

Prospective record updated: 0 scored / 1 regime-invalidated.

Friday’s registered prediction was never actually tested under its stated conditions because Brent reversed upward immediately.

This is useful.

A sloppy research system would either count today’s decline as a failure or invent a reason to count Friday’s signal as successful.

We do neither.

Forecast + explicit\ regime\ condition
\rightarrow
condition\ violated
\rightarrow
\boxed{NO\ SCORE}.

That’s an important improvement in our calibration machinery: forecast invalidation and forecast failure are different states.

We should eventually track four outcomes:

\{Hit,\ Miss,\ Invalidated,\ Unresolved\}.

Otherwise regime-dependent models get unfairly rewarded or punished.

